  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1376f052a41f43242b6634233346e3e4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Any4.4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  speakerName: ROXANNE
  line: ('ve looked at this from every angle since I found it. I know my own scarf.
    I know the way I tie things. That knot was mine. Except I wasn't there. Those
    two things are both true and I cannot make them fit together and I am standing
    in a room full of people who think that means I'm lying.)
